          "evidence": "explicit"
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "instruction": "Add 1 more tablespoon oil to the wok, turn up the heat to high, and add the tomatoes and scallions. Stir-fry for 1 minute, and then add 2 teaspoons sugar, ½ teaspoon salt, and ¼ cup water (if your stove gets very hot and liquid tends to cook off very quickly in your wok, add a little more water). Add the cooked eggs.",
          "duration": "1 minute",
          "heat": null,
          "evidence": "explicit"
        },
        {
